        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I seached the Forums but could not find an answer, hoping someone could help. &nbsp;If a card is in play, such as an environment card like Hostage Situation, or Paparazzi on the Scene, which say &quot;Hero Cards Cannot Be Played&quot; or &quot;Heros Cannot Use Powers&quot;, can you still draw an extra card if you don&#39;t perform the other condition. &nbsp;</p><h6>&nbsp;</h6><p>To clarify further, if Hostage Situation is in play and Hero Cards Cannot Be Played, am I able to draw an extra card if I don&#39;t use a power on my turn? &nbsp;Both conditions are seemingly met. &nbsp;I have neither played a card (Due to Hostage Situation) nor have I used a power (Due to my own volition), ergo I can draw an extra card.</p><h6>&nbsp;</h6><p>Or do I not get to draw an extra card because the not playing a card portion of this condition was not of my own volition?</p><h6>&nbsp;</h6><p>Thanks</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
