        "created_at": "2014-04-28T16:36:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Conversely, if something lets you draw an <span class=\"bbcode-i\">extra</span> card during your Draw phase (Nightmist's Mist Form and Bunker's Recharge Mode both do this) and you neither play a card nor use a power, you would get to draw <span class=\"bbcode-i\">three</span> cards - two plus the extra one :).</p>",
